    "body": "The reference implementation was doing [steps 8 and 9](https://streams.spec.whatwg.org/commit-snapshots/4f2a2c1012342885b2c2d7608fa58ef81631b058/#readable-byte-stream-controller-pull-into) *after* calling `TransferArrayBuffer`, which meant that `view.byteLength` was already `0`. We didn't notice this, because we weren't *actually* transferring before. 😛\n\nFortunately, all \"real\" implementations already do this correctly.",
