    "body": "I'm using `transferToFixedLength()` since we don't (yet) support [resizable `ArrayBuffer`s](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/ArrayBuffer#resizing_arraybuffers).\n\nI think we can loosen that restriction, but we should do that in an *actual* spec change. 😉",
